tor of Student Support Services (TRIO Grant) STAFF - VA - 2600024P Student Support Services Staff Student Support Services The Office of Student Support Services of Montana State University-Northern (MSUN) seeks applications for their Project Director position. This position is a 12-month, full-time professional and eligible for MUS Benefits. View Details Bookmark Administrative Associate Ill - COHS STAFF - VA - 2600021P Nursing Staff Nursing The College of Health Sciences of Montana State University-Northern seeks applications for their Administrative Associate III position. This position is full-time, which is equivalent to 40 hours per week, and eligible for MUS Benefits. View Details Bookmark Financial Aid Specialist I, Rev. 5/11/2026 STAFF - VA - 2600020P Financial Aid Staff Financial Aid The Office of Financial Aid at Montana State University-Northern (MSUN) is seeking applications for a Financial Aid Specialist I position. View Details Bookmark Faculty Member for Diesel Technology/Agricultural Mechanics Technology (Tenure Track or Non-Tenure Track) FAC - VA - 2600005P Diesel Technology Faculty Diesel Technology The College of Technical Sciences at Montana State University Northern (MSUN), invites applications for a 10-month (academic-year), faculty position in Diesel Technology/Agricultural Mechanics Technology to begin August 1, 2026. This position may be filled as a tenure track Assistant Professor or a non-tenure track Lecturer I. Effective teaching is the primary mission of MSU-Northern.The benefi... View Details Bookmark Faculty Member for Automotive/Diesel Technology (ATDI) (Tenure Track or Non-Tenure Track) FAC - VA - 2600004P Automotive Faculty Automotive The College of Technical Sciences at Montana State University-Northern (MSUN), invites applications for a 10 month (academic-year), faculty position in Automotive/Diesel Technology (ATDI) to begin August 1, 2026. This position may be filled as a tenure track Assistant Professor or a non-tenure track 